{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22d5370a352aa022469e821f8f310b216272fa00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{x(x-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6440c0edc00f4ce79ec3bd81e0f219c267f02e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/84243b3df0793fe01f4e2081e5eb0245e247cc1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ f(x)+f(2) \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ (x+2)f(x) \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x(x+2)f(x) \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{xf(x)}{x+2}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{(x+2)f(x+1)}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"82\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6440c0edc00f4ce79ec3bd81e0f219c267f02e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4631bcb32d5ad2e5769a37a0c9c7cf3a29916b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x+2)=\\frac{(x+2)(x+1)}{2}.\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />\nThen simplify the answers and see which one matches.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/1/3b1578d33eb869d8fa55363a3187483e96d552e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f(2)=\\frac{x(x-1)}{2} + 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"221\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5e2e68de460772107f320c9a51c71436ffe443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2)f(x)=\\frac{(x+2)x(x-1)}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"245\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/8775f58545a9ca9194e0e7311df614c5426a92ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x+2)f(x)=\\frac{(x+2)x^2(x-1)}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"263\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/b/bab186ef3dca7589d1b2ff699a1909c081796d9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{xf(x)}{x+2}=\\frac{x^2(x-1)}{2(x+2)},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"155\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08c15846ab74011ef2dffd05af83eab9a215d94a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(x+2)f(x+1)}{x}=\\frac{(x+2)(x+1)}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"270\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c12b99909d314fdd587434d1ab82ab9907af9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+2)=\\frac{(x+2)f(x+1)}{x}=\\frac{(x+2)(x+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"355\" height=\"38\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11ebae549eb4b736afa7dc1e604e8d3a48533dc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{(x+2)f(x+1)}{x}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"174\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Pr